# wear/woman/tile_dots: the woman's dots: scattered dots, staggered from row to row;
# laid as a tile over her garments' cloth in the pattern slot, the cloth's shading kept (tags tile; doll.h). GARB-W (P2b).
use person
body woman
role overlay dots
legend X pattern 2
layer torso
anchor neck
keys rest
tags tile

view D key rest origin 0 0
|X.....
|......
|......
|...X..
|......
|......
